msgstr "帮助：<I=SEL>"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xd449d6/0x0827ec
msgid "Choose which profile to view."
msgstr "选择要查看的档案。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xd449d6/0x908dce
msgid ""
"You can recruit VERSUS OPS MEMBERS worldwide online.\n"
"Select the type of invitation."
msgstr "可在线上招募全球对战任务成员。\n选择邀请方式。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xd449d6/0x98e96f
#: olang/009c9ea4/0xd449d6/0xc4b92e
msgid "PLAYER PROFILE"
msgstr "玩家档案"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xda3cb1/0xb81e44
msgid "Note"
msgstr "注"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xda3cb1/0xfdb176
msgid ""
"Note\n"
"\n"
"The player name chosen will be visible to other players, KONAMI,\n"
"and in places accessible by third parties authorized by KONAMI.\n"
"Consequently, it may appear in images and videos posted on platforms\n"
"such as Discord, Facebook, YouTube, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Please avoid using any name that could be used to identify an\n"
"individual, enable contact or communication with an individual,\n"
"infringe on the rights of third parties, violate public decency,\n"
"or otherwise breach any applicable terms of service of this title."
msgstr "注意\n\n所选择的玩家名称将对其他玩家、KONAMI 可见，\n并会出现在 KONAMI 授权的第三方可访问的场所。\n因此，它可能会出现在发布在 Discord、Facebook、YouTube 等\n平台上的图像和视频中。\n\n请避免使用任何可用于识别个人、\n能够联系或与个人通信、\n侵犯第三方权利、违反公共道德、\n或以其他方式违反本作品任何适用服务条款的名称。"

#: olang/009c9ea4/0xdac0c9/0x348931
msgid "TARGET CAPTURE COUNT"
msgstr "目标捕获数"

