msgstr "自动选择频道并在该频道内创建房间。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xcbef27
msgid "Search for a HOST located in a specified Channel."
msgstr "在指定频道内搜索主机。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xcd6204
msgid "GAMER CARD："
msgstr "玩家卡："

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xd0a2e0
msgid "Invitation Type"
msgstr "邀请类型"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xd16be3
msgid "You need to be signed into Xbox LIVE to access Xbox LIVE gameplay features."
msgstr "需登录Xbox LIVE才能使用Xbox LIVE游戏功能。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xd515b9
msgid "INVITATION SCREEN:"
msgstr "邀请画面："

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xd5f0ec
msgid ""
"All CO-OPS MEMBERS have left the game.\n"
"Do you want to start a one-player game?"
msgstr "所有合作任务成员已离开游戏。\n是否开始单人游戏？"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xd6829c
msgid "Search for MAIN OPS only."
msgstr "仅搜索主线任务。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xde719d
msgid "Invitation Screen"
msgstr "邀请画面"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xe24599
msgid "DOMESTIC"
msgstr "国内"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xe4a86b
msgid "Create a room that can only be joined with an invitation."
msgstr "创建仅限受邀者加入的房间。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xe5bd78
msgid "Restricted"
msgstr "受限"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xe841f6
msgid "Unrestricted"
msgstr "不受限"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xeb9470
msgid "Recruit MEMBERS within the same country as you."
msgstr "招募与你同国的成员。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xecc746
msgid "FRIENDS ONLY"
msgstr "仅限好友"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf3ecad
msgid "Difficulty of 2"
msgstr "难度2"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf3ecae
msgid "Difficulty of 3"
msgstr "难度3"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf3ecaf
msgid "Difficulty of 4"
msgstr "难度4"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf3ecb1
msgid "Difficulty of 6"
msgstr "难度6"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf5da7d
msgid "Search for missions at a difficulty level of 3 or lower."
msgstr "搜索难度3或以下的任务。"

#: olang/00cb1fb7/0x68bb2b/0xf6831d
msgid "The current gamer profile cannot be used for online multiplayer gaming."
msgstr "当前玩家档案无法用于在线多人游戏。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62a7fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"use up and down on the Right Stick \n"
"to move your line of sight."
msgstr "用右摇杆上下\n移动视线。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62a87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"use left and right on the Right Stick\n"
"to move your line of sight!"
msgstr "用右摇杆左右\n移动视线！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62d87d/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with the left stick, \n"
"then tap the Attack Button to roll!"
msgstr "用左摇杆奔跑，\n再按攻击键翻滚！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62d87e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Run with the left stick, \n"
"then press the Crouch Button to roll!"
msgstr "用左摇杆奔跑，\n再按蹲伏键翻滚！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62d9fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"To strike an enemy, press \n"
"the Hand-to-hand Attack Button while standing still! "
msgstr "原地站立时按\n徒手攻击键攻击敌人！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62d9fe/0x000001
msgid "On my command, "
msgstr "听我口令，"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62d9fe/0x000002
msgid ""
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"repeatedly and take down your opponent!"
msgstr "连按徒手攻击键\n击倒对手！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62dafe/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button without moving!  "
msgstr "不要移动，按\n徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000001
msgid "position yourself near your opponent \r"
msgstr "靠近对手"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000002
msgid ""
"and press the Attack Button \n"
"while you tilt the left stick."
msgstr "推动左摇杆时\n按攻击键。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000003
msgid ""
"Be sure to press the Attack Button \n"
"when the icon appears."
msgstr "图标出现时\n务必按攻击键。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6457fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick! "
msgstr "推动左摇杆时\n按攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6457fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick! "
msgstr "推动左摇杆时\n按徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6458fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick!"
msgstr "推动左摇杆时\n必须按攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6458fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Hand-to-hand Attack \n"
"Button as you tilt the left stick!"
msgstr "推动左摇杆时\n必须按徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent,\r"
msgstr "要制住对手，"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"hold down the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button while near them. \r"
msgstr "靠近后按住\n徒手攻击键。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Restrain your opponent \n"
"on my command. \r"
msgstr "听我口令\n制住对手。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64687e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"while near your opponent! "
msgstr "靠近对手时按\n徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6468fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button while next to your opponent!"
msgstr "在对手身旁时\n必须按徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x646b7d/0x000000
msgid "To throw an enemy to the ground, \r"
msgstr "要把敌人摔倒在地，"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x646b7d/0x000001
msgid ""
"press a direction on the left stick \n"
"when you have them restrained. "
msgstr "制住后推动\n左摇杆方向。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x647a7e/0x000001
msgid ""
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"to restrain them, then press RB."
msgstr "按徒手攻击键\n制住他，再按RB。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x649bfd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Tilt the left stick while \n"
"restraining the opponent! "
msgstr "制住对手时\n推动左摇杆！"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000001
msgid ""
"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other. \r"
msgstr "你只能一个\n接一个解决。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000002
msgid "To do it, \r"
msgstr "为此，"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"again while throwing the current enemy.\r"
msgstr "只需在扔出当前敌人时\n再次按下徒手攻击键。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000004
msgid ""
"Just be sure to wait for the Icon \n"
"to appear. \r"
msgstr "只要等图标\n出现就行。"

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64ab7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, \r\n"
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"when the icon appears! "
msgstr "BOSS，\r\n图标出现时按下\n徒手攻击键！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bd8
msgid ""
"Could it be...\r\n"
"the great cacique...\r\n"
"has come to lead us…"
msgstr "难道……\r\n伟大酋长……\r\n来带领我们……"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bd9
msgid ""
"We are few in number, but we will win. \r\n"
"Victoria o muerte. For a revolutionary, there is no other fate."
msgstr "我们人少，但我们会赢。\r\n胜利或死亡。革命者别无他命。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bda
msgid ""
"Revolution is a means and not an end, I know. \r\n"
"When the revolution is victorious,I want my country to be at peace.\r\n"
"But to bring peace, we have to first eliminate that traitorous scum."
msgstr "革命是手段而非目的，我明白。\r\n革命胜利后，我希望我的国家和平。\r\n但要带来和平，得先消灭那叛徒渣滓。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b558
msgid "Listen up. For us, there is no victory."
msgstr "听着。我们赢不了。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b559
msgid ""
"We gave up our homes. \r\n"
"But we're still alive.\r\n"
"We're still fighting.\r\n"
"And there's always another reason \r\n"
"to keep on living."
msgstr "我们舍弃了家园。\r\n但我们还活着。\r\n我们还在战斗。\r\n而且总有新的理由\r\n活下去。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b55a
msgid ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a gun,\n"
"and sooner or later you're going to hell."
msgstr "不管革不革命，你拿起枪，\n迟早都得下地狱。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b55b
msgid ""
"We go where we're needed, \r\n"
"fighting not for country, not for government,\r\n"
"but for ourselves.\r"
msgstr "哪里需要我们，我们就去哪，\r\n不为国家，不为政府，\r\n只为自己。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f416
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\r\n"
"to protect my namesake. \r\n"
"It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr "我叫帕兹，我会不惜一切\r\n守护我的同名之物。\r\n这是我唯一的目的。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f417
msgid ""
"Crying about it won't bring it about, or make it last.\r\n"
"Each one of us must go and seek it out."
msgstr "哭泣不会让它到来，也不会让它长久。\r\n我们每个人都得自己去寻找。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f418
msgid ""
"Do not worry about me... I am an angel of peace.\n"
"I will be watching over you."
msgstr "别担心我……我是和平天使。\n我会守护你。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374f9e
msgid ""
"That's why I agreed to help develop it... \r\n"
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\r\n"
"that perfect deterrent, \r\n"
"we must show the world our strength."
msgstr "所以我同意帮忙开发它……\r\n嗯哼。不过，要实现\r\n那完美的威慑力，\r\n我们必须向世界展示实力。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374f9f
msgid ""
"...Peace won't just come to us, doc.\r\n"
"We are going to have to go meet it halfway."
msgstr "……和平不会自己来找我们，博士。\r\n我们得主动去迎接它。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa0
msgid "No, machines don't make mistakes. Only men do."
msgstr "不，机器不会犯错。只有人会。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa1
msgid ""
"The age of heroes is over, buried alongside\r\n"
"The Boss and her bankrupt beliefs."
msgstr "英雄的时代结束了，随THE BOSS\r\n和她破产的信念一同埋葬。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa2
msgid ""
"In the end, it's not their lives that \r\n"
"people value most... it's their reputations!"
msgstr "到头来，人们最看重的\r\n不是性命……而是名声！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x863cee
msgid ""
"We know who you are, Big Boss.\r\n"
"That is why we've come to you."
msgstr "我们知道你是谁，BIG BOSS。\r\n所以才来找你。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x863cef
msgid ""
"Central America is the navel\r\n"
"of the American continents, \r\n"
"bridging North and South.\r\n"
"We want this land."
msgstr "中美洲是美洲大陆的\r\n肚脐，\r\n连接南北。\r\n我们要这片土地。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c53e
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \r\n"
"what you did 10 years ago.\r\n"
"Go on, kill me like you killed her.\r\n"
"Kill me like you killed The Boss.\r\n"
"Kill me!"
msgstr "是的，我知道。就像我知道\r\n你10年前做了什么。\r\n来吧，像杀她那样杀了我。\r\n像杀THE BOSS那样杀了我。\r\n杀了我！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c53f
msgid ""
"That filthy title given you as reward for murder…\n"
"Do you still wear it with pride?"
msgstr "那因杀人而赏给你的肮脏头衔……\n你还骄傲地戴着吗？"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c540
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \r\n"
"to kill a true hero.\r\n"
"Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr "你借任务之名\r\n杀害真正的英雄。\r\n这就是你所谓的忠诚？回答我！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c541
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \r\n"
"from the woman I loved. \r\n"
"You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr "得不到我爱之人的答案，\r\n我绝不罢休。\r\n你我一样。我们都是行尸走肉。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c542
msgid ""
"I have no use for fabrications...\r\n"
"I want the truth... The Boss' last will."
msgstr "我不信捏造……\n我要真相……THE BOSS的遗志。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c543
msgid ""
"I'm only interested in one thing.\r\n"
"The truth."
msgstr "我只对一件事感兴趣。\n真相。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d965
msgid ""
"...Everyone treats me like a child.\r\n"
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \r\n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr "……大家都把我当小孩。\n我、我、我受够了。\n我不是小鬼。我都十二岁了！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d966
msgid ""
"Let me know if you encounter\n"
"any wildlife you've never seen before."
msgstr "要是见到没见过的野生动物\n记得告诉我。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d967
msgid "When I grow up, I wanna be a hunter."
msgstr "等我长大了，要当猎人。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d968
msgid ""
"The enemy could strike at any time.\r\n"
"I can't sit around taking my sweet time eating!"
msgstr "敌人随时可能打过来。\n我可没空慢悠悠地吃饭！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949db
msgid ""
"I've been thinking of giving up on studying birds\n"
"and learning to fly myself."
msgstr "我一直在想，与其研究鸟\n不如学着自己飞。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949dc
msgid ""
"Becoming one with the forest is the very essence of birdwatching,\n"
"they won't behave naturally if they sense a human nearby.\n"
"And that can really affect your observations."
msgstr "与森林融为一体才是观鸟的精髓，\n一感觉到有人靠近，鸟就不会自然活动了。\n这很影响观察。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949dd
msgid ""
"I think it is an insult to the birds to give\n"
"their names to weapons, don't you?"
msgstr "把鸟名安在武器上，\n我觉得是侮辱鸟，你不觉得？"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949de
msgid "You people are such culinary savages! "
msgstr "你们真是烹饪野蛮人！"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f415
msgid ""
"What, you'd rather keep wandering \r\n"
"from conflict to conflict,\r\n"
"tools in the hands of whoever's \r\n"
"fighting at the time?"
msgstr "怎么，你宁愿继续流浪\r\n从一个冲突到另一个冲突，\r\n让工具落在当时\r\n正在战斗的人手里？"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f416
msgid ""
"Exactly. We know only how to fight... \r\n"
"but we refuse to live our lives at the whim of the state."
msgstr "没错。我们只知道怎么战斗……\n但我们拒绝让国家随意摆布我们的人生。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f417
msgid ""
"No one man could bear the burden of total genocide. \r\n"
"It's what's allowed our cowardly species to survive all this time."
msgstr "没有人能背负种族灭绝的全部罪责。\n正是这一点让我们这懦弱的物种活到今天。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f418
msgid ""
"You've left everything behind - your country, your identity,\n"
"your past and ideals... \r\n"
"But there's still one thing you haven't let go of."
msgstr "你抛下了一切——国家、身份、\n过去和理想……\n但还有一样东西你没放下。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f419
msgid ""
"The truth won't change the past.\n"
"You still want to know?"
msgstr "真相改变不了过去。\n你还想知道？"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x18bd2e
msgid "CO-OPS MEMBER'S FRIENDS"
msgstr "合作成员战友"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x2f41f2
msgid "Save a record of your game."
msgstr "保存游戏记录。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x43da9e
msgid "Retry"
msgstr "重试"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x5c60d3
msgid "TO GAME SELECT"
msgstr "返回游戏选择"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x607a12
msgid ""
"You need to be signed into your gamer profile when a game begins in order to save data.\n"
"To create saved data, return to the title menu and select \"New Game\" while you are already signed into your gamer profile."
msgstr "游戏开始时需要登录玩家档案才能保存数据。\n要创建存档，请先登录玩家档案，再返回标题菜单选择“新游戏”。"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0x9ee1c6
msgid "Players: "
msgstr "玩家："

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0xa92a66
msgid "CO-OPS MEMBER"
msgstr "合作成员"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x482e82/0xfd73c3
msgid "Do you want to exit the game?"
msgstr "要退出游戏吗？"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x78a26d/0xb880f5
msgid "[NML] Normal staff [VOL] Staff who volunteered"
msgstr "[NML] 普通士兵 [VOL] 志愿入伍的士兵"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x7ad3c0/0x180afd
msgid "Retrieving information..."
msgstr "正在获取信息……"

#: olang/00d0c740/0x7ad3c0/0x59f3e0
msgid "Retrieving server information..."
msgstr "正在获取服务器信息..."

#: olang/00d0c740/0x7ad3c0/0x7443f1
msgid "Accessing server..."
msgstr "连接服务器..."

#: olang/00d0c740/0x7d7537/0x885a47
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: olang/00d0c740/0xe0fc42/0x9657d1
msgid "System Data"
msgstr "系统数据"

#: olang/00d0c740/0xf70e60/0x2fe904
msgid "HEROISM"
msgstr "英雄度"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000043
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5A2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat."
msgstr "作为西德军队主力步枪G3衍生型开发的冲锋枪。使用欧洲标准9mm弹药，火力大致中等。\n\n与多数冲锋枪不同，MP5A2采用闭膛待击结构，精度优于同类。凭借更高的精度，可在比其他冲锋枪更远的距离精确瞄准特定部位，手感接近突击步枪。中近距离作战的可靠选择。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000044
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5A2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat.\n"
"\n"
"Equipped with a limited-use suppressor. The suppressor will eventually wear out, so use it prudently."
msgstr "作为西德军队主力步枪G3衍生型开发的冲锋枪。使用欧洲标准9mm弹药，火力大致中等。\n\n与多数冲锋枪不同，MP5A2采用闭膛待击结构，精度优于同类。凭借更高的精度，可在比其他冲锋枪更远的距离精确瞄准特定部位，手感接近突击步枪。中近距离作战的可靠选择。\n\n配备有限次使用的消音器。消音器会逐渐损耗，请谨慎使用。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000045
msgid ""
"A submachine gun created as an offshoot of the G3, the mainstay rifle of the West German military. It uses European standard 9mm ammo with more or less average firepower.\n"
"\n"
"This model features a built-in suppressor, so the suppression effect never wears off.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most submachine guns, the MP5SD2 uses a closed-bolt firing mechanism, which puts it a cut above its competitors in terms of accuracy. This higher accuracy allows for precision targeting of specific body parts at a greater distance than other submachine guns, giving it an almost assault rifle-like feel. A solid choice for close- to mid-range combat."
msgstr "作为西德军队主力步枪G3衍生型开发的冲锋枪。使用欧洲标准9mm弹药，火力大致中等。\n\n本型号内置消音器，消音效果不会损耗。\n\n与多数冲锋枪不同，MP5SD2采用闭膛待击结构，精度优于同类。凭借更高的精度，可在比其他冲锋枪更远的距离精确瞄准特定部位，手感接近突击步枪。中近距离作战的可靠选择。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000124
#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000125
#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000126
#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000127
#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000128
msgid ""
"A popular monthly magazine jam-packed with excitement on every page. It has a massive fan base that stretches all the way from the southern part of the U.S. to the Panama Canal, and a circulation of 1.1 million copies per month. One especially popular feature is the pen pal exchange page.\n"
"\n"
"Some CIA mercenaries and MSF members are known to be avid readers of this mag. Put it in front of them and they just might drop everything else..."
msgstr "一本每页都精彩纷呈的月刊杂志。从美国南部到巴拿马运河都拥有庞大粉丝群，月发行量110万册。其中笔友交流栏目尤其受欢迎。\n\n据说部分CIA雇佣兵和MSF成员也是这本杂志的忠实读者。放到他们面前，说不定会放下手头一切..."

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000054
msgid "Jigsaw made of steel wire. Alternate pressing LT and RT to use."
msgstr "钢线制成的开锁工具。交替按LT和RT使用。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000057
msgid "High-quality rangefinder camera. Equip to look through rangefinder, then press <I=ATK> to press shutter button."
msgstr "高品质测距仪相机。装备后可透过测距仪观察，按<I=ATK>按下快门。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000059
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range and speed."
msgstr "分析敌人信息的装置。经改造提升了搜索范围和速度。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x00005a
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Even when unequipped, you can still gather info on enemy machinery and higher-ranking soldiers by pressing <I=STA>."
msgstr "分析敌人信息的装置。即使未装备，按<I=STA>仍可收集敌方机械和高级士兵的信息。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x00005b
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x00005c
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range, speed, and accuracy of analysis."
msgstr "分析敌人信息的装置。经改造提升了搜索范围、速度和分析精度。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000060
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Might be able to fit two people. Select from the Equipment window and press <I=×> to \"DROP\" in order to set."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。或许能装下两个人。在装备窗口选择后按<I=×>执行“放下”即可设置。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000087
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000088
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000089
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x00008a
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material (colored). Modified to improve durability."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾牌（彩色）。经改造提升了耐久度。"

#: olang/00d345a5/0x0864ad/0x000162
msgid ""
"Rathalos\n"
"A winged wyvern, also known as the \"King of the Skies.\" And it certainly lives up to its name. With its deadly breath and claw attacks, Rathalos is synonymous with death from above.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr "火龙\n有翼飞龙，人称“天空之王”。它确实名副其实。凭借致命的吐息和利爪攻击，火龙就是来自天空的死亡代名词。\n\n<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: olang/00d345a5/0x0864ad/0x000163
msgid ""
"Tigrex\n"
"With a rock-solid body and razor-sharp fangs that can tear through anything, Tigrex is truly the king of beasts. Nothing can stand in its way when it charges. Rub it the wrong way, and you may as well start saying your prayers.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr "轰龙\n岩石般坚硬的身躯加上能撕碎一切的锐利牙，轰龙堪称兽中之王。它冲锋时无人能挡。惹怒了它，就赶紧祈祷吧。\n\n<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

